### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/ready

### Published zones
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/flexibility/zones

### Replace timestamps with the interval printed when the demo starts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/flexibility?zone_id=ES-MA-29700&from=2026-09-12T12:30:00Z&to=2026-09-12T13:30:00Z

### Reservation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-001

{
  "zone_id": "ES-MA-29700",
  "interval_start": "2026-09-12T12:30:00Z",
  "interval_end": "2026-09-12T12:45:00Z",
  "direction": "UPWARD",
  "power_kw": 10,
  "consequence_type": "DEFER"
}
